{
 "_comment": "Capacity session from launch 5 (21 Oct 2026): capacity_v5_vocab.json with big relayed every 2,500 steps (three reclaims today; a 5,000-step relay lost an hour) and lever 2 bringing home its ledger, reports and a SHA256SUMS of the text and dialogue files computed on the VM, not the 2.3 GB of files (the fetch is pinned and deterministic; the next launch re-fetches on its VM). The runner now downloads data outputs one file per tick, so relays never wait on them. Training source is unchanged from c65c1bfe.",
